# ===== 文件路径：原文件\.gitignore =====
# 说明：Customized Browser v1（初版原型）Git 忽略规则

# ---- Visual Studio / .NET 构建产物 ----
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
*.exe
*.exe.config
*.pdb
*.dll
*.resources
*.cache
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z

# ---- Visual Studio 用户级配置 ----
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.VisualState.xml

# ---- 编译/测试临时文件 ----
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*~

# ---- 操作系统 ----
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---- Python（preview.py 原型脚本）----
__pycache__/
*.pyc
